                "questionOptions": [
                    "I felt overwhelmed by the flooding.",
                    "I felt anxious while watching the flooding progress.",
                    "I felt inspired to learn more about flooding.",
                    "I felt hopeful it would get better.",
                    "I felt inspired to act."
